    .string "It needs a TRAINER…\n"
    .string "Maybe it would go with you?$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_LunaGoingHome:
    .string "My mom must be so worried!\n"
    .string "I'm going back to the POKéMON\l"
    .string "CENTER right now!$"
